{"type": "concept", "subtype": "method", "title": "冲突中：公开自己的感受", "content": "父母应公开自己的感受，告诉孩子某些话或行为让自己难过、刺痛，并解释为什么要求或禁止某些事情。不要只说“习惯不好、规矩不好”等表面理由，而要说明真实的担忧，例如因为担心安全而禁止在外过夜。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["理解情绪"], "tags": ["感受表达", "沟通"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-49eb8028a43f-c001:a009", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-49eb8028a43f", "blocks": ["b00008", "b00009", "b00010"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-2", "relations": [{"target": "s-49eb8028a43f-c001:a010", "kind": "prerequisite", "condition": "在冲突处理中", "reason": "“冲突中：公开自己的感受”是“冲突中：简单简短说明观点”的前置步骤，先表达感受再简要说明观点，避免啰嗦。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis", "review_status": "revised", "review_notes": "原 step_of 不准确，改为 prerequisite。"}, {"target": "s-49eb8028a43f-c001:r002", "kind": "example_of", "condition": "公开感受", "reason": "“冲突中：公开感受的具体例子”是“冲突中：公开自己的感受”的具体实例，包含告诉孩子某些话让自己刺痛、解释禁止原因等。原方向应反转：具体例子指向概念。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis", "review_status": "revised", "review_notes": "方向应反转。"}, {"target": "s-49eb8028a43f-c001:r002", "kind": "same_source_point", "condition": "Read both records and the shared source point; this is not a causal assertion.", "reason": "s-49eb8028a43f-c001:u0010", "evidence": "point_source_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-49eb8028a43f-c001:u0010"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
