{"type": "concept", "subtype": "method", "title": "冲突中：准备妥协", "content": "父母应准备妥协，不妥协意味着没有解决问题的能力。如果解决问题只能通过压住对方，则无法解决且无法影响孩子。妥协可以通过协商达成折中方案。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["界限"], "tags": ["妥协", "协商", "冲突解决"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-49eb8028a43f-c001:a011", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-49eb8028a43f", "blocks": ["b00012", "b00013"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-49eb8028a43f-c001:a013", "kind": "step_of", "condition": "在冲突中", "reason": "妥协可能需要让步和道歉。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}, {"target": "s-49eb8028a43f-c001:a012", "kind": "example_of", "condition": "妥协", "reason": "a012是a011的妥协案例。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}, {"target": "legacy:nl-ca-06", "kind": "complements", "condition": "补充概念：冲突中应准备妥协；解释妥协是解决问题的能力，压住对方会失去影响", "reason": "提供一般性原则，强调妥协的重要性，补充了旧知识后半句的理论依据。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-49eb8028a43f-c001:u0012"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
