{"type": "concept", "subtype": "method", "title": "19-25岁阶段处理：改正过去错误", "content": "父母需要改正过去的错误。例如，如果曾偷看孩子日记，现在应非常尊重孩子的隐私和界限，坚决不越界；如果曾打骂孩子，现在应尊重孩子的安全感，避免道德绑架和情绪勒索。即使无法撤销过去的行为，仍可以通过在将来注意、以前没做到现在做到来修正与孩子的关系。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["界限"], "tags": ["改正", "隐私", "安全感"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-49eb8028a43f-c001:a019", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-49eb8028a43f", "blocks": ["b00022", "b00023", "b00024", "b00025"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-2", "relations": [{"target": "s-49eb8028a43f-c001:r004", "kind": "example_of", "condition": "改正过去错误", "reason": "“19-25岁阶段处理：改正错误的具体例子”是“改正过去错误”的具体实例，如偷看日记后尊重隐私、打骂后尊重安全感。原方向应反转。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis", "review_status": "revised", "review_notes": "方向应反转。"}, {"target": "s-49eb8028a43f-c001:r004", "kind": "same_source_point", "condition": "Read both records and the shared source point; this is not a causal assertion.", "reason": "s-49eb8028a43f-c001:u0020", "evidence": "point_source_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-49eb8028a43f-c001:u0020"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "method", "title": "冲突前准备：青少年大脑发育特点", "content": "青少年的大脑发育特点导致他们可能看不到风险与后果，倾向于认为坏事不会发生在自己身上，而且可能无法从父母已经发育成熟的角度来看待事情。这不是故意针对父母，而是大脑发育未成熟所致。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["阶段与角色"], "tags": ["青少年大脑", "风险认知"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-49eb8028a43f-c001:r001", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-49eb8028a43f", "blocks": ["b00002"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-2", "relations": [{"target": "s-49eb8028a43f-c001:a002", "kind": "supports", "condition": "青少年阶段", "reason": "“青少年大脑发育特点”指出青少年看不到风险、大脑未成熟，支持“在小问题上保持灵活”的做法，因为父母应理解其发育限制，不苛求。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis", "review_status": "supported", "review_notes": "支持成立。"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-49eb8028a43f-c001:u0002"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
